  "release_notes_md": "## v0.2.2 \u2014 Maintenance release\n\nNo configuration changes and no action required. Existing installs can apply this from the in-product **Updates** page.\n\n### Improvements\n- **Faster license-state propagation.** Activating or removing a license now reflects in event processing within about a minute, instead of taking up to an hour to reach the ingest workers. (The periodic re-verification remains in place as a backstop, so time-based changes such as support-plan expiry are unaffected.)\n\n### Internal cleanup\n- Removed legacy licensing code paths now that all field installations use the current (v3) licensing format: the pre-v3 license-blob fallback, the retired trial-issuer key, and obsolete local signing scripts.\n\n_All container images were rebuilt for this release._\n",
